citations.review_text:
best coop game ever made. fun with any number of ppl even solo, dirt cheap, could run on a toaster, endless mod support, idiosyncratic, and w the split screen mod one of the better party game experiences. pure unfettered joy contained in a game. Few games have aged this well; 
Nostalgia clouds the senses, and upon reexamination that burst of magic you remembered can dull.  
I cling onto the memory of the idyllic whimsy I had as a kid, surrounded by cousins, bathed in crttv glow, hiss, and chaos as we try to get through a flooded, zombie filled cornfield during a raging storm. Fast forward two decades and I’m watching my wife, who doesn’t play games, experience that same joy as we make the same perilous trek back to the boat. What a special game.
